		{"id":"d6f8c860d4c55fe1","type":"text","text":"R1","x":1596,"y":486,"width":71,"height":50},
		{"id":"f29b8df36279290c","type":"text","text":"SP1","x":1755,"y":486,"width":80,"height":50},
		{"id":"6a0457bdc075f084","type":"text","text":"R2","x":1596,"y":551,"width":71,"height":50},
		{"id":"e40ed901b0656bf1","type":"text","text":"SP1","x":1755,"y":551,"width":80,"height":50},
		{"id":"b2b98f8c8c4b0155","type":"text","text":"R1","x":1596,"y":632,"width":71,"height":50},
		{"id":"b7b7ec4f04cde904","type":"text","text":"SP1","x":1755,"y":632,"width":80,"height":50},
		{"id":"c491f556277e093a","type":"text","text":"R2","x":1596,"y":697,"width":71,"height":50},
		{"id":"e149fbbe0649226d","type":"text","text":"SP2","x":1755,"y":697,"width":80,"height":50},
		{"id":"92157cea52a26b11","type":"text","text":"R1","x":1596,"y":781,"width":71,"height":50},
		{"id":"105d14e1c5bb646e","type":"text","text":"SP1","x":1755,"y":781,"width":80,"height":50},
		{"id":"76448eb3af5b11b6","type":"text","text":"R2","x":1596,"y":846,"width":71,"height":50},
		{"id":"861861bee48a38a5","type":"text","text":"SP2","x":1755,"y":846,"width":80,"height":50},
		{"id":"bda475c1633d1ab0","type":"text","text":"DSL","x":2039,"y":151,"width":407,"height":60,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"63f4f6b43f1081f5","type":"text","text":"- DSL provides internet connectivity to customers over phone lines, and can share the same phone line that is lready installed in most homes.\n- A DSL modem (modulator-demodulator) is required to convert data into a format suitable to be sent over the phone lines.\n\t- the modem might be a separate device, or it might be incorporated in to the 'home router'","x":2039,"y":211,"width":407,"height":300},
		{"id":"06aecf8477bd9a53","type":"text","text":"Cable Internet","x":2039,"y":571,"width":407,"height":60,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"d7935406cf70575e","type":"text","text":"- Cable Internet provides internet access via the same CATV (Cable Television) lines used for TV service.\n- Like DSL, a cable modem is required to convert data into a format suitable to be sent over the CATV cables. \n\t- Like a DSL modem, this can be a separate device or built into the home router","x":2039,"y":631,"width":407,"height":300},
		{"id":"31928f56f02542d5","type":"text","text":"Internet Connections","x":2580,"y":288,"width":434,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"935bfebd93eed125","type":"text","text":"- Countless ways for an enterprise to connect to the internet\n\t- Private WAN tech such as leased lines and MPLS VPNs can be used to connect to a service provider's internet infrastructure\n- Technologies such as CATV and DSL commonly used by consumers (home internet access) can also be used by an Enterprise\n- These days, for both enterprise and consumer Internet access, fiber optic Ethernet connections are growing in popularity due to the high speeds they provide over long distances.","x":2580,"y":348,"width":434,"height":390},
		{"id":"55bcb7081dbb9fd8","type":"text","text":"R1","x":1596,"y":405,"width":71,"height":50},
		{"id":"6a48bf0d421f66c6","type":"text","text":"SP1","x":1755,"y":405,"width":80,"height":50},
		{"id":"d9d2d94487dfc3d6","type":"text","text":"1.","x":1480,"y":411,"width":71,"height":50,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"ed9745338fa96c32","type":"text","text":"2. ","x":1480,"y":526,"width":71,"height":50,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"003d9c779c9604a2","type":"text","text":"3.","x":1480,"y":672,"width":71,"height":50,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"2b65e747463af6aa","type":"text","text":"4.","x":1480,"y":821,"width":71,"height":50,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"51135024de835c73","type":"text","text":"1. Single Homed - 1 connection to 1 ISP\n2. Dual Homed - 2 connections to 1 ISP\n3. Multihomed - 1 connection to each of 2 ISPs\n4. Dual Multihomes - 2 connections to each of 2 ISPs","x":1430,"y":198,"width":474,"height":150},
		{"id":"683be082ca9bb035","type":"text","text":"Redundant Internet Connections","x":1430,"y":134,"width":474,"height":60,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"2df6ff39a5ad9e63","type":"text","text":"<span style=\"font-size: 100px;\">Wireless Architecture</span>","x":-1785,"y":-442,"width":637,"height":370,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"0194a71fa8d4a94d","type":"text","text":"<span style=\"font-size: 100px;\">LAN</span>","x":105,"y":1720,"width":280,"height":178,"color":"5"}
	],
